## 3. Non-Goals

- This is not a general-purpose TON wallet or a consumer product — single-operator system, not multi-tenant.
- Not a market-making or MEV-extraction system; it is a directional spot-trading agent for jettons on TON DEXs.
- Not attempting to defend against a fully compromised host machine (OS/container hardening is assumed, not re-specified here).
- Not covering the internal implementation details of the already-built rug-detection heuristics, prompt-sanitization filters, or exit-policy math — this document specifies their *place in the architecture and their interfaces*, not their internals (those live in the existing module suite).

