Master wallet key: cold-storage/hardware-backed, never present on the orchestration host. Strategy sub-wallet keys: held only by the `@ton/mcp` process, injected via environment/secret manager, never logged, never included in the decision journal in raw form (only wallet addresses and transaction hashes are journaled). LLM API keys and RPC provider keys: standard secret-manager injection, scoped per environment.

