Consistent with existing Cloudflare-first infrastructure preference: orchestration process and `@ton/mcp` (stdio mode) co-located on a single always-on host for Phase 1 (simplicity, lower latency between reasoning and execution); Telegram bot webhook can be fronted by a Cloudflare Worker; a future Phase can split `@ton/mcp` into its serverless mode once the custody model has been proven out in `mainnet-live-capped`.

